4. Customizing and Sharing :
·	Add Feedback: Under the answer key, you can provide "Add answer feedback" to explain why an answer is correct or incorrect.
·	Collect Emails: Turn on email collection in settings to track which individuals have completed the assessment.
·	Preview: Use the eye icon to take the test yourself.
·	Send/Share: Click Send and copy the link to share with participants. 
5. Reviewing Results :
Once completed, you can click on the Responses tab to view:
·	Summary of scores.
·	Which questions were missed most often.
·	Individual scores for each participant
